Package: IntegrinECM
Type: Package
Title: Structure-Aware Scoring of Integrin and Extracellular Matrix Assemblies
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Yiming", "Liang", email = "l19963860854@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts non-negative, linear-scale gene-expression measurements
    into sample-specific scores for predefined molecular structures. The package
    implements non-negative least-squares allocation and a stoichiometry-weighted
    geometric mean, followed by within-sample normalization, percentage scoring,
    and ranking.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/LIANGYM-LEO/IntegrinECM
BugReports: https://github.com/LIANGYM-LEO/IntegrinECM/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    nnls,
    writexl
